Key Outcome of Milestone 2
Milestone 2 proved that machine learning can accurately detect anomalies and that KNN and Logistic Regression are strong baseline models for Trufflow.

Milestone 3: Insights, Explainability, and Final System Design
Purpose of Milestone 3
The purpose of Milestone 3 is to turn model outputs into meaningful insights and design a system that can be used by real users. This milestone answers the question: How do we explain and present anomalies in a useful way?
Definition of an Insight
An insight is not just an anomaly score. It includes:
•	What changed
•	How large the change was
•	When it happened
•	Why it matters
Insight Types
Insight Type	Description
Spike	Sudden increase in traffic or cost
Drop	Sudden decrease in activity
Error Surge	Rapid rise in error_rate
Cost Drift	Gradual increase in cost over time
LLM Based Summarization
A language model was used to convert raw anomaly data into short text summaries. Template based summaries were compared with a small T5 model.
Summary Quality Comparison
Method	Clarity	Accuracy	Speed
Template	High	High	Very Fast
T5 small	Medium	Medium	Slower
