System Architecture Overview
The final Trufflow system follows these steps:
1.	Ingest raw transactions
2.	Aggregate data hourly
3.	Generate features
4.	Run anomaly detection models
5.	Create insights
6.	Present results to users
Key Outcome of Milestone 3
Milestone 3 connects technical results to real business value by explaining anomalies clearly and designing a usable end to end system.

Final Conclusion
Across all three milestones, Trufflow demonstrates that large scale transaction monitoring can be automated with high accuracy. The system reduces manual work, detects issues early, and provides clear explanations that help teams take action quickly.
